{'symbol': 'ADSK', 'date': '2021-04-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'AUTODESK TO ACQUIRE UPCHAIN TO ACCELERATE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT DATA AND PROCESSES IN THE CLOUD', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, APRIL 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AUTODESK, INC. (NASDAQ: ADSK) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE UPCHAIN, A PROVIDER OF INSTANT-ON, CLOUD-BASED PRODUCT LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT (PLM) AND PRODUCT DATA MANAGEMENT (PDM) SOLUTIONS. THE ACQUISITION POSITIONS AUTODESK TO DELIVER MORE VALUE FOR ENGINEERS, MANUFACTURERS, SUPPLIERS AND OTHER PRODUCT STAKEHOLDERS BY INCREASING COLLABORATION ACROSS THE DECENTRALIZED PRODUCT VALUE CHAIN, REGARDLESS OF CAD SYSTEM.'}